#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.5.rst:4
msgid "v4.1.5"
msgstr "v4.1.5"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.5.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.1.5 is a maintenance release that bundles OpenMV firmware v4.5.2 for all "
"supported boards. It remains based on Qt Creator 10.0.1, with no rebase in "
"this range, and there are no breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"v4.1.5 es una versión de mantenimiento que incluye el firmware de OpenMV "
"v4.5.2 para todas las placas compatibles. Sigue basándose en Qt Creator "
"10.0.1, sin rebase en este rango, y no hay cambios incompatibles."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.5.rst:13
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "En esta página"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.5.rst:16
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Aspectos destacados"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.5.rst:18
msgid "**Bundled firmware updated to v4.5.2** for every supported board."
msgstr ""
"**Firmware incluido actualizado a v4.5.2** para todas las placas "
"compatibles."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.5.rst:21
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Compatibilidad de plataforma y herramientas"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.5.rst:23
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 10.0.1."
msgstr "**Base de Qt Creator:** 10.0.1."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.5.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Bundled OpenMV firmware:** updated from v4.5.1 to v4.5.2 for all supported"
" boards, including OpenMV2/3/4/4P/PT, OpenMV RT1060, and the Arduino GIGA, "
"Nano RP2040 Connect, Nicla Vision, Portenta H7, and Nano 33 BLE Sense "
"(`ea8f7732f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/ea8f7732f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Firmware de OpenMV incluido:** actualizado de v4.5.1 a v4.5.2 para todas "
"las placas compatibles, incluidas OpenMV2/3/4/4P/PT, OpenMV RT1060 y las "
"Arduino GIGA, Nano RP2040 Connect, Nicla Vision, Portenta H7 y Nano 33 BLE "
"Sense (`ea8f7732f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/ea8f7732f>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.5.rst:30
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Cambios incompatibles"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.5.rst:32
msgid ""
"None. This release only updates the bundled firmware and does not change any"
" IDE workflow or behavior."
msgstr ""
"Ninguno. Esta versión solo actualiza el firmware incluido y no cambia ningún"
" flujo de trabajo ni comportamiento del IDE."
